=== Computing Rododdle ===

The problem asks for the expected minimum convex hull
perimeter/area over all possible rod configurations.
With N rods of lengths following a specific sequence,
we need to compute the expected optimal value.

Test case with rod lengths: 1 1 2 3 5

For each rod, it can be horizontal (contributes length)
or vertical (contributes to height). The convex hull
perimeter is 2*(max_x - min_x + max_y - min_y).

PE answer: 0.1091523673
